Package: ubuntu-iceland-device
Version: 0.2.12
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Ubuntu iceland port contributors <noreply@example.invalid>
Depends: systemd, kmod, e2fsprogs, util-linux, cloud-guest-utils,
 systemd-zram-generator
Description: Device support for the OnePlus Pad 4 (iceland)
 Board-specific integration for the OPD2514 running an Ubuntu userspace on
 the Perpetua mainline kernel:
 .
  * root filesystem discovery: the initramfs conf.d that points
    initramfs-tools at LABEL=UBPAD4_ROOT, because the stock vendor_boot
    cmdline carries no root= and is deliberately never rewritten;
  * first-boot root filesystem expansion to the whole userdata partition;
  * two-tier swap: zstd-compressed zram in front of the storage.
 .
 This package grows the way its gts9u counterpart did: one integration at a
 time, each added only when the matching regression has been observed on this
 hardware.  Hardware enablement lives in the kernel and in the firmware
 overlay; this package only carries userspace integration.
